's restored complete suite passes. Integrated reports are retained under `docs/ess/evidence/final/`; independent review is retained under `docs/ess/evidence/review/`.\n\nAcceptance requires the full repository gate and complete declared execution, with no failure, error, unsupported observation or skip. AEP suite/27 evidence admission and final normative adoption remain explicitly blocked by blocker:er-ess-suite27-evidence; this implementation does not change ER behavior or add other provider scope.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":2,\"review_outcome\":1}}","target":"ent-e0311c146edfb95d39cda6043478ef56","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790561206603,"id":"ent-e0311c146edfb95d39cda6043478ef56","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/er-shell-query-contracts","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":6,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790565919607}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-e0311c146edfb95d39cda6043478ef56","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790565919607,"causation":"cmd-child-0aa769dbe6becb761ab838384b48dc5f004268a47275ae3715fe515a7c8ff66a","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-e0311c146edfb95d39cda6043478ef56@6#0~47c8deac7c09eb3d","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-28T03:25:19Z"},"revision":6,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790561206603,"id":"ent-e0311c146edfb95d39cda6043478ef56","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/er-shell-query-contracts","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":6,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790565919607}},"body":"# Shell and query executable contracts\n\nThe accepted scope covers shared synchronous shell operations over supplied MemoryStore and FileStore, plus containm